# Powers the "Refresh" button's live India/Remote job lookup via Adzuna's public API.
# 1. Register free at https://developer.adzuna.com/ (Sign up -> Get your API key)
# 2. Copy this file to .env.local and paste your credentials below
# 3. Restart the dev server (or redeploy) for the values to take effect
#
# Without these set, the Refresh button still works — it just re-serves the
# curated snapshot in src/lib/jobs.ts instead of live-checking Adzuna.
# UAE has no compliant public jobs API, so UAE listings always come from the
# curated snapshot regardless of these keys.

ADZUNA_APP_ID=
ADZUNA_APP_KEY=
